  "method": "1000 kernel-off hot requests per revision; matched DCS sys/app control events and Lauberhorn events; all intervals in source-delay-corrected FPGA trace time; no CPU clock fit. Every request conserves MAC-to-MAC time. Means add, independently computed medians need not.",
  "hardware_revisions": {
    "old": "6f5fa076",
    "new": "45cbfe52d6166e0b05b4434ab9c3aa9dfee3a7c4"
